            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<strong>A Flashlight is the only weapon. Light creatures and stop them.</strong><br><br>'Light It ~ terashi-oni ~' is a 2D stealth action game with a game element of 'Red light Green light'. Light creatures and stop them. Explore a dark island.<br>You can’t defeat enemies. The flashlight is the only weapon. Listen for their sounds carefully to avoid the encounter with them.<br><br>You can play with original levels made by an external editor 'Tiled'.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique graphics with vivid colored lines.<br></li><li>20 challenging levels.<br></li><li>A Flashlight is the only weapon. Light and stop creatures to avoid the encounter with them.<br></li><li>Use electricity strategically. The Flashlight has a rechargeable battery. You can recharge on site, but it makes a big noise. So enemies will know your position from that sounds. Consider where you charge to prevent such a situation.<br></li><li>This island is so dark that you can see only parts lighted. Listen sounds of enemies to avoid the encounter with them.<br></li><li>There are various items. Attach a bell on enemies; Use a kitchen timer to lure enemies; Set monitoring camera to get enemy’s position; Make a waterhole to make enemies leave footprints.<br></li><li>Buttons of gamepad is settable. Assign actions to buttons you like.<br></li><li>The ranking of speedrun.<br></li><li>Play your original levels made by an external editor.<br></li><li>Various achievements: saving all people on the island, clearing levels without damages and so on.<br></li><li>Save system with Steam Cloud.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Required Gamepad</h2>Playing with a gamepad is strongly recommended.<br><br>Keyboard and mouse is available, but it is not comfortable.<br>1 hat (direction-pad), 1 analog pad, and 7 buttons are required on a gamepad.",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>A Flashlight is the only weapon. Light creatures and stop them.</strong><br><br>'Light It ~ terashi-oni ~' is a 2D stealth action game with a game element of 'Red light Green light'. Light creatures and stop them. Explore a dark island.<br>You can’t defeat enemies. The flashlight is the only weapon. Listen for their sounds carefully to avoid the encounter with them.<br><br>You can play with original levels made by an external editor 'Tiled'.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique graphics with vivid colored lines.<br></li><li>20 challenging levels.<br></li><li>A Flashlight is the only weapon. Light and stop creatures to avoid the encounter with them.<br></li><li>Use electricity strategically. The Flashlight has a rechargeable battery. You can recharge on site, but it makes a big noise. So enemies will know your position from that sounds. Consider where you charge to prevent such a situation.<br></li><li>This island is so dark that you can see only parts lighted. Listen sounds of enemies to avoid the encounter with them.<br></li><li>There are various items. Attach a bell on enemies; Use a kitchen timer to lure enemies; Set monitoring camera to get enemy’s position; Make a waterhole to make enemies leave footprints.<br></li><li>Buttons of gamepad is settable. Assign actions to buttons you like.<br></li><li>The ranking of speedrun.<br></li><li>Play your original levels made by an external editor.<br></li><li>Various achievements: saving all people on the island, clearing levels without damages and so on.<br></li><li>Save system with Steam Cloud.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Required Gamepad</h2>Playing with a gamepad is strongly recommended.<br><br>Keyboard and mouse is available, but it is not comfortable.<br>1 hat (direction-pad), 1 analog pad, and 7 buttons are required on a gamepad.",
